  triage:title "Missing regression test for total external-hook failure path" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/send/hook.rs:128-146 -- missing required regression test \"total external-hook failure returns sender-visible warning.\" No test configures only-failing hook rule(s) (matched_rules > 0, succeeded_rules == 0) to exercise the PostSendEmissionOutcome::Failed branch; the only failure-adjacent test (mixed_success_hook_accounting_preserves_delivery_and_warning) has one success and exercises Delivered, not Failed." ;
